                                "sense_id": "bdf83631-fe90-3744-bfdd-e95e1f037ef5",
                                "text": "I have learnt the secret of others from my own heart, and that taught me that my cousin had for me only the affection of a brother. How unlike my own feverish, untranquil, and fearful fondness for him! yet how kind he always was! how tender in his even feminine care of me!"
